      "source": "https://aptoshistory.org/?p=90"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1833 Mexican Governor Jose Figueroa confirmed the Aptos Rancho, and Rafael Castro built his house where Aptos and Valencia Creeks meet.",
